; Ag. proton-47. period 5, transition metal. valence: 1.
; highest electrical conductivity of all elements.
; highest thermal conductivity of all metals.
; antimicrobial: Ag⁺ ions disrupt bacterial cell membranes.
; photography: AgBr crystals on film decompose under light (photochemistry).
; mirrors: silver coating on glass (highest optical reflectivity).
; alloys: sterling silver (92.5% Ag + 7.5% Cu).

